        "status": "accepted",
        "notes": "review1 doubtful: Headword, gender and form pl noge are right, and the first example is natural. The doubt is the second example, Moja noga je v redu: Slovenian normally leaves out the possessive with one's own body part, so moja reads as a calque of my leg and as a sentence built to show the word. Noga je v redu would be the natural form. Fix: Noga je v redu.; review2 doubtful: Headword, gender and pl form are correct. The doubt is the second example: 'Moja noga je v redu.' sounds translated, since Slovenian normally drops the possessive with a body part unless there is a contrast. Fix: Noga je v redu."
